Date: Mon, 7 Sep 2026 21:49:49 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1116/3799] soh: rename func_80026230 -> Gfx_SetFogPulseOpa

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: emits a fog colour and position into POLY_OPA_DISP with the fog distance driven by the absolute cosine over a full half-turn, so it dips and returns over the caller's timer; the colour defaults to red when NULL is passed.
Defined in soh/src/code/z_eff_ss_dead.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
